DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261004
SUMMARY:✓ Easy run · 6 km
DESCRIPTION:Done: 6.0 km parkrun jogged at 5:20/km\, avg HR 145\n\n• 5:20
 –5:45/km\, conversational\n• A parkrun jogged easy counts\n\nWhy: Loos
 ens the legs before Sunday.\n\nFuel: None needed. Eat a normal carb-based 
 meal afterwards.\n\nHeart rate guide (estimated from your recent runs\, ma
 y be off):\n• 5:20–5:45/km: easy\, HR 125–150. Over 150 means slow d
 own\n\nhttps://joshuamorley.github.io/running-plan/#plan
URL:https://joshuamorley.github.io/running-plan/#plan
