BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:akl-2026-10-04@joshuamorley.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261007T022859Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261004
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261005
SUMMARY:✓ Long run · 29 km rolling hills
DESCRIPTION:Done: 29.0 km in 2:37:48\, +219 m. 24 km at 5:35/km (avg HR abo
 ut 130)\, then 5 km at 4:18/km\, quickening from 4:24 to 4:13 (HR 153–16
 8). 5 gels\, stomach fine. Felt really good\n\n• 5:30–5:45/km for the 
 first 24 km\, HR under 150\n• Last 5 km at 4:20/km only if your legs hav
 e recovered from Tuesday. Otherwise stay easy\n• Run the hills by effort
 \, not pace\n\nWhy: Builds time on your feet and starts training your gut 
 to take race fuel.\n\nFuel: Gut training starts here. Eat your planned rac
 e breakfast 2.5–3 h before. Take a gel every 25 min from 25 min in (abou
 t 6)\, each with water. That's about 60 g of carbs per hour.\n\nHeart rate
  guide (estimated from your recent runs\, may be off):\n• 5:30–5:45/km
 : easy\, HR 125–150. Over 150 means slow down\n• 4:17–4:23/km: HR ab
 out 158–170\n\nhttps://joshuamorley.github.io/running-plan/#plan
URL:https://joshuamorley.github.io/running-plan/#plan
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
