DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261006
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261007
SUMMARY:✓ Morning intervals · faster than race pace · 13 km
DESCRIPTION:Done instead: 7 × 1 min hard\, 1 min walk recovery (2:44–3:3
 3/km\, max HR 183)\, 7.5 km total. The 3 × 3 km is dropped\, not made up\
 n\n• Moved from Thursday. No evening 5k this week\n• 1.5 km easy warm-
 up\n• 3 × 3 km at 4:05/km\, 2 min jog between\n• 1.5 km easy cool-dow
 n\n• If you can't hold 4:05 on rep 3\, stop. That means you need recover
 y\, not more work\n\nWhy: Faster than sub-3 pace\, so 4:15 feels comfortab
 le by comparison.\n\nFuel: None during. Have carbs and protein within an h
 our afterwards.\n\nHeart rate guide (estimated from your recent runs\, may
  be off):\n• 5:20–5:45/km: easy\, HR 125–150. Over 150 means slow do
 wn\n• 4:03–4:07/km: HR about 165–175\n\nhttps://joshuamorley.github.
 io/running-plan/#plan
URL:https://joshuamorley.github.io/running-plan/#plan
