BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:akl-2026-10-10@joshuamorley.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261007T022859Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261010
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261011
SUMMARY:Long run · 33 km · Test 1
DESCRIPTION:• First 25 km easy at 5:30–5:45/km\n• Last 8 km at 4:15/k
 m\, your sub-3 race pace\n• Note your average pace and HR over the last 
 8 km\, and whether the final 2–3 km slowed\n• If you slow by more than
  10 s/km\, ease back to easy and jog it home. That's your answer for Decis
 ion 2\n\nWhy: Sub-3 pace on tired legs is the closest you can get to the l
 ast 10 km of the race.\n\nFuel: Full race rehearsal. Race breakfast 3 h be
 fore\, a gel 10–15 min before you start\, then gels on your race schedul
 e (see the Fuel tab)\, each with water. Use your race-day flavour mix: non
 -caffeine early\, caffeine gels from about km 18.\n\nHeart rate guide (est
 imated from your recent runs\, may be off):\n• 5:30–5:45/km: easy\, HR
  125–150. Over 150 means slow down\n• 4:13–4:17/km: HR about 158–1
 70\n\nhttps://joshuamorley.github.io/running-plan/#plan
URL:https://joshuamorley.github.io/running-plan/#plan
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
